    "body": "We used an offline VM running a copy of our Agie Classic Cut 2S machine control. We imported the two die openings in one plate. The control plotted ten cutting blocks, contained the cuts within their respective openings and applied the four inward offsets on all 76 faces. Each rough separation measured 1 mm.\n\nAll controller runs were offline. No physical cut was made.\n",
